name tikzpingus
category Package
revision 68310
shortdesc Penguins with TikZ
relocated 1
longdesc tikzpingus is a package similar to tikzducks but with penguins
longdesc and a vast set of gadgets and extras (capable of changing the
longdesc wing-positions, body-types, and more).
